{
  "_comment": "Example stack profile: TypeScript, Python and Rust (plus web). Applied on top of default.json with: scripts/apply.sh --profile ts-py-rust. Copy this file to profiles/<yours>.json and edit: which language servers to enable, which ECC agents your stack never uses.",
